  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DSIF - Vietnam - Vi Thanh Wastewater and Sanitation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support green growth and improvement of living conditions for the population in Vietnam. By the establishment of a wastewater treatment plant, the environmental conditions in the city of Vi Thanh will significantly improve and support the local government&#xbf;s efforts to create a more effective supply of public services. The project will be able to serve 48,900 people (in 2024) in the main city centre. The treatment plant will have the capacity to treat 7,000 m3/day, and will be designed for possible expansion at a later stage.</narrative>
  </description>
